# Assignment 1: Student Information Script

## Question

Write a Bash script that accepts Student Name, Roll Number, and Course Name from the user and displays the entered information.

## Solution

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Enter Student Name:"
read name

echo "Enter Roll Number:"
read roll

echo "Enter Course:"
read course

echo ""
echo "----- Student Details -----"
echo "Name     : $name"
echo "Roll No. : $roll"
echo "Course   : $course"
```


# Assignment 2: Area Calculator

## Question

Write a Bash script to calculate the area of a rectangle.

## Solution

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Enter Length:"
read length

echo "Enter Width:"
read width

area=$((length * width))

echo "Area = $area"
```



# Assignment 3: Grade Calculator

## Question

Accept marks from the user and display the corresponding grade.

## Solution

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Enter Marks:"
read marks

if [ $marks -ge 90 ]
then
    echo "Grade = A"
elif [ $marks -ge 75 ]
then
    echo "Grade = B"
elif [ $marks -ge 60 ]
then
    echo "Grade = C"
elif [ $marks -ge 40 ]
then
    echo "Grade = D"
else
    echo "Fail"
fi
```



# Assignment 4: Largest Number Finder

## Question

Write a script to find the largest of two numbers.

## Solution

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Enter First Number:"
read a

echo "Enter Second Number:"
read b

if [ $a -gt $b ]
then
    echo "Largest Number = $a"
else
    echo "Largest Number = $b"
fi
```



# Assignment 5: Sum of First N Numbers

## Question

Write a Bash script to calculate the sum of numbers from 1 to N.

## Solution

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Enter N:"
read n

sum=0

for ((i=1;i<=n;i++))
do
    sum=$((sum+i))
done

echo "Sum = $sum"
```



# Assignment 6: Factorial Calculator

## Question

Write a Bash script to calculate the factorial of a given number.

## Solution

```bash
#!/bin/bash

echo "Enter Number:"
read num

fact=1

for ((i=1;i<=num;i++))
do
    fact=$((fact*i))
done

echo "Factorial = $fact"
```



